# ============================================================================
#  RobloxStudioLive - what must never be published
# ============================================================================
#
#  Everything hidden here is one of three things:
#
#    (a) your own game - the scripts this tool mirrors out of your place,
#    (b) machine-local state - absolute paths, your Windows username, your
#        placeId, the hash baseline for your place, and
#    (c) credentials, defensively - nothing in this project needs one today.
#
#  None of it is required to *use* the tool.  A fresh clone gets everything it
#  needs from `init.cmd`, which recreates every runtime file listed below.
#
#  Rule of thumb: if a file only exists on your machine, add it here first and
#  then check that it stays out with
#
#      git status --short
#
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Your game, mirrored out of Studio --------------------------------------
# The daemon writes your place's scripts here.  Committing this folder would
# publish your game.  It still exists locally; it is simply never tracked.
src/

# --- Machine-local state ----------------------------------------------------
# sync-state.json        the 3-way diff baseline: every script path in your
#                        place, plus content hashes and the placeId
# config/settings.json   your roots, intervals and placeId
# config/structure.json  a dump of your place's instance tree (`rss tree`)
# config/python-path.txt the interpreter init.cmd validated on this machine
# .rss-daemon.lock       pid of the running daemon
sync-state.json
.rss-daemon.lock
config/settings.json
config/structure.json
config/python-path.txt
config/*.bak

# --- Logs -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Every line carries an absolute path, and therefore your username.
logs/

# --- Backups ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Full copies of both sides of your place, taken before sync was enabled.
backups/

# --- Python -----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
*.egg-info/

# --- Credentials and secrets ------------------------------------------------
# This project holds no tokens: it drives Roblox Studio through Studio's own
# MCP binary over stdio, and Roblox does not ask it for an API key.  These
# patterns are here so that a stray key can never be committed by accident.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials.json
secrets.json
secrets.toml
.rss-secrets.json

# --- Editors and OS ---------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# --- Scratch and transient --------------------------------------------------
# Conflict copies are parked beside your script by design; `.rss-tmp` is the
# atomic-write staging name and must never survive a commit either.
*.conflict-*.luau
*.rss-tmp
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig
*.rej
